*
# Descend into subdirectories, or the re-includes below can never match:
# once `*` excludes a directory, git stops walking it and no `!pattern`
# inside can rescue a file. This is why sweeps/4c/*.manifest.json — the
# provenance record of the 4c/4d corpus — went untracked.
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.manifest.json
!universe.txt
